  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed\r\ndevelopment, by reason of its height, proximity to the boundary of the\r\nneighbouring property, and topography of the land, results in the proposal\r\nbeing significantly higher than the neighbour&#x27;s garden area as there is a\r\nraised patio there on which this structure sits, which will give rise to a loss\r\nof visual and residential amenity, and would appear as overbearing and out of\r\nkeeping. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;No clear\r\njustification has been provided for this conflict with adopted policy and\r\ntherefore objection is raised to the proposal as being contrary to the National\r\nPlanning Policy Framework (2026) Policies DP3: 1 and DP3: 3, the London Plan\r\nPolicy D3, the London Borough of Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) Policy GR1, and\r\nthe Residential Design Guide Supplementary Planning Document paragraph 6.78&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
